     The ppcchhtthheerrmm driver provides access to sensor data and configuration in‐
     stalled in Intel PCH chipset.  ppcchhtthheerrmm configuration register.

     The access to ppcchhtthheerrmm data is made via the sysctl(8) interface:

     dev.pchtherm.0.ctt: 115.0C
     dev.pchtherm.0.temperature: 28.5C
     dev.pchtherm.0.t2temp: 91.0C
     dev.pchtherm.0.t1temp: 86.0C
     dev.pchtherm.0.t0temp: 81.0C
     dev.pchtherm.0.tahv: 83.0C
